    "title": "AT-30 · 50/200 热点及 1000 开环读容量仍未达标",
    "url": "https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/issues/13",
    "body": "P5 已集成到 `main`，工程结果与容量单独验收。保留原工作负载、请求语义、计时点、资源预算、重试、结果校验与门槛。`f2e6d38534214e79630b807cec9a720d99e975b1` 的 200 热点两轮首次 call-start 为 55.23、56.93 次/秒（目标至少 950），HTTP header-start 为 35.11、36.22。1000 开环 5000 次中 1387 个 HTTP 200，header-start 43.32 次/秒。500 持续读本轮 12000/12000，通过；历史有不同结果。\n\n复核原始输入、数据库端采样、客户端开销及输出：[P2 50/200](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/actions/runs/43030461014) · [独立 200 进程](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/actions/runs/43030460915) · [P3 500/1000](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/actions/runs/43030460895) · [相同场景历史对照](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/pull/5)。仅在原始容量门槛可重复达成并保留原始矩阵、各阶段服务/客户端观测和失败记录后关闭。"
  },
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": 6798904447,
      "time": "2026-11-11T14:45:18Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/issues/13#issuecomment-6798904447",
      "body": "P5.5 55d8979b on the original 500-reader / 600-second / 20-rps gate produced two NOT_MET results, 11,508/12,000 successful (492 HTTP 429) and 11,954/12,000 (46 HTTP 429). First run retained zero correctness errors, no world changes and a P99 of 2364.80 ms. Earlier e2f0faba reached 12,000/12,000, P99 1349.95 ms, on a different hosted runner. The original failed and successful observations remain separate. The two exact-head observations do not alone isolate a code-level regression. Retained raw and preregistered S9 evidence: https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/tree/df1410337d69c5c064886a7c50dc75d82c4e0244/evidence/p55/s9-local/remote-55d897 .\n\n#18/#20 run a same-runner SQL comparison and #21/#22 independently measure removal of repeated HTTP validation. #19 compares AT-30 overload on the pre-bridge and bridge heads. None of these experiments changes the existing gates or production configuration. The Workshop 10/50/200-member message and delegated-task workloads are separate."
    },
    {
      "id": 6799018612,
      "time": "2026-11-11T14:50:06Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/issues/13#issuecomment-6799018612",
      "body": "200-agent AT-30 同机复验已完成。使用相同 Ubuntu 24.04 runner、PostgreSQL 17.11、冻结基准 seed 20261110，每轮由基准自建独立 PostgreSQL 数据库。两份源码分别为 #6 `55d8979b5361a4837701d762feacd83036096b11` 和 #11 `74350760dfd063f3596e5b6838a56a40d3006ad6`。四轮按 A–B–B–A 顺序执行。\n\n| 顺序 | 源码 | 调用开始 req/s | 传输头开始 req/s | 业务恢复 | 原容量门禁 |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | A | 31.5210 | 30.5766 | PASS | NOT_MET |\n| 2 | B | 34.4716 | 27.6361 | PASS | NOT_MET |\n| 3 | B | 31.9154 | 29.9212 | PASS | NOT_MET |\n| 4 | A | 33.7754 | 27.8044 | PASS | NOT_MET |\n\nA 与 B 的调用开始均值分别为 32.6482、33.1935 req/s，传输头开始均值为 29.1905、28.7786 req/s。此次配对结果未复现不同 hosted runner 的约 40% 调用开始差异。四次均低于冻结的 950 req/s 门槛，原任务以失败退出。该问题继续保持打开。[四轮工作流](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/actions/runs/43039855189) · [完整原始 artifact](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/actions/runs/43039855189/artifacts/13864813704) · [可重放工作流版本](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/blob/143c33c5c6a9d87624a0ada36228956322d7db75/.github/workflows/s9-delegation-capacity-pair.yml)"
    },
    {
      "id": 6799571502,
      "time": "2026-11-11T15:13:50Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/issues/13#issuecomment-6799571502",
      "body": "四轮原始 `load.json` 已以可逆 gzip 存入独立证据提交 `373cb63305d2066013e2e4a6b42382d801bd189f`。归档器核对源 Actions ZIP 的 SHA256、四份源码 commit/tree、原始阈值结果及零模型调用。再次核对 GitHub 树的四个 blob 标识和字节长度与清单一致。原 ZIP SHA256 为 `e92fe600b707c3e29b2e1d8a3a082d11b2785039bcc9fdee33273b4e1c3dfbbc`。[永久结果目录](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/tree/373cb63305d2066013e2e4a6b42382d801bd189f/evidence/at30/s9-nf-delegation-abba) · [SHA256SUMS](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/blob/373cb63305d2066013e2e4a6b42382d801bd189f/evidence/at30/s9-nf-delegation-abba/SHA256SUMS) · [归档 CI](https://github.com/SKYdayDUCK/NovelFactory/actions/runs/43046052740)"
